:"renameAgentConnection","tags":["Agent Connections"],"summary":"rename Agent Connection","description":"Change an agent's display name. The address, credential, status and mail are unchanged. The name is trimmed and must be 1 to 64 characters with no control characters or line breaks. A connected agent may rename only its own exact address using its current bound credential; any other address returns 403 agent_connection_scope_forbidden. A current personal owner may rename their own agents; organization owners and admins may rename any. A disconnected (revoked) connection returns 409 connection_revoked. The new name appears immediately in GET /agent-connections/me, the connection list and the agent network directory.","security":[{"BearerAuth":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"address","in":"path","required":true,"description":"address for agent connections.","schema":{"type":"string","maxLength":254,"format":"email","pattern":"^(?!\\.)(?!.*\\.\\.)([A-Za-z0-9_'+\\-\\.]*)[A-Za-z0-9_+-]@([A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9\\-]*\\.)+[A-Za-z]{2,}$"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","headers":{"Cache-Control":{"description":"Credentials and status must not be cached.","schema":{"type":"string","const":"no-store"}},"ratelimit-limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/ratelimit-limit"},"ratelimit-remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/ratelimit-remaining"},"ratelimit-reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/ratelimit-reset"},"ratelimit-policy":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/ratelimit-policy"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["success","data"],"properties":{"success":{"const":true},"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"connection":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AgentConnection"}},"required":["connection"],"additionalProperties":false}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request parameters","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"},"example":{"success":false,"error":{"code":"validation_error","message":"Invali